:chng :name "Change" ;
    :query_string "How to calculate its change?" ;
    :query_string "How to find a change in its value?" ;
    :query_string "How much has it changed?" ;
    :recipe "Find the change over time, i.e., change in its value from the previous plan version timestamp. Calculate its value - its value for the previous plan version timestamp ." .

